This repository holds code only. The model weights are downloaded at run time from https://huggingface.co/WhissleAI/arc-v1:
Arc weights (model.safetensors) under CC BY-NC 4.0, and a modified version of the Moonshine Streaming tiny speech model
by Useful Sensors, Inc. (dba Moonshine AI) (https://huggingface.co/moonshine-ai/moonshine-streaming-tiny,
https://github.com/moonshine-ai/moonshine) under the MIT License (licence and copyright notice retained in that repository's
moonshine-streaming-tiny/LICENSE). Its encoder and decoder weights were changed by WhissleAI.

arc_audio/rescorer.py contains a fallback copy of the Metaphone function from jellyfish (https://github.com/jamesturk/jellyfish),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2015 James Turk. It is used only when the jellyfish package is not installed.

The optional local finals tier (transcript="parakeet") downloads NVIDIA Parakeet-TDT 0.6B v2 (CC-BY-4.0) through NeMo at run time;
it is not included here.

examples/example_synth.wav is synthetic speech generated with the Kokoro-82M text-to-speech model (hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, Apache-2.0)
from a script with fictional names; it contains no recording of a real person.

Deepgram and Verbit are third-party services; this repository only contains client code for their public APIs and no credentials.
